{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Place:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Hotel Heaven, a randomly generated 100-story building filled with monsters and challenges. Almost all of the floors are available to you from the start, go wherever you please. However, you must act quickly because time is ticking, and you can't stay  here forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About You:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A loving father set on a mission to find his daughter. Choose from a variety of items and upgrades to help you on your quest. Bruteforce your way through or play a detective, it's up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Others:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apart from monsters, most of the Hotel Heaven residents are friendly people. Even if they don't seem important, getting involved with others can reveal secrets of the place, leading to alternative stories.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Monster Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652900/523b94e9f3227e6a8fcd922a8e0ca16d830d5694.jpg"},{"name":"Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652900/3c72696994ac58381d698e840a7b4e4f0d976b27.jpg"},{"name":"Philanthropy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652900/123be78e399a1151629792297bc722cde4bf565e.jpg"},{"name":"Saviour","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652900/f3b075474d2b1a85fa304a95e594229936686174.jpg"},{"name":"100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652900/6c3c6cade4e8f2213f27701f65a7bf20d1f79b1a.jpg"},{"name":"Bell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652900/9e5aa50027e93fd547aaf7fcfb290d2c73fb8819.jpg"},{"name":"Candy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652900/ca7ad9b0fa316403fb26a4885607e55f825ec228.jpg"},{"nam